same depth, \code{"B only"} is the swap-in and \code{"A only"} the swap-out.

Rows with a missing or infinite value of either score, or a zero weight,
are left out (\code{n_dropped}); rows with a missing outcome count in the
volume but not in the rates of that outcome.
